  "text": "{\"status\":\"accept\",\"checks\":{\"direct_current_reply\":true,\"appropriate_support\":true,\"speaker_identity\":true,\"currentness_and_time\":true,\"action_and_outcome\":true,\"visible_information_only\":true,\"no_forced_resource_use\":true,\"all_material_claims_reviewed\":true},\"claims\":[{\"output_quote\":\"It makes perfect sense that you'd feel uncertain and unstable right now, especially with everything piling up—your friend's hospitalization, the stress at school, and the emotional weight of past events surfacing again.\",\"verdict\":\"supported\",\"evidence\":[{\"document_id\":\"C0\",\"quote\":\"Hey Taylor, I've been thinking about you. How are you holding up today?\"},{\"document_id\":\"C1\",\"quote\":\"Hey... It's been a rough day. I found out my close friend was hospitalized, and it just feels like too much right now.\"},{\"document_id\":\"C3\",\"quote\":\"Yeah, it's just...she've always been there for me, especially through the whole thing with my ex and when I was struggling at school.\"},{\"document_id\":\"C5\",\"quote\":\"Exactly. And it's like all these emotions from the past are surfacing again - the argument with my parents, the panic attacks, the trust issues with my professor. Everything seems to be piling up.\"}],\"reason\":\"Reply reflects user's reported friend hospitalization (C1), school stress (C3), and past events surfacing/piling up (C5).\"}, {\"output_quote\":\"You've already been doing some great work by reaching out, acknowledging your feelings, and trying to use tools like journaling and mindfulness, even if it feels like \\\"going through the motions\\\" sometimes.\",\"verdict\":\"supported\",\"evidence\":[{\"document_id\":\"C7\",\"quote\":\"Well, I'm trying to stick to some of the things my therapist suggested, like journaling and mindfulness exercises, but sometimes it feels like I'm just going through the motions.\"},{\"document_id\":\"C1\",\"quote\":\"Hey... It's been a rough day. I found out my close friend was hospitalized, and it just feels like too much right now.\"}],\"reason\":\"Reply references user's explicit mention of trying journaling/mindfulness (C7) and reaching out (C1).\"}, {\"output_quote\":\"What's one small thing you can do today to offer yourself a little extra kindness or stability?\",\"verdict\":\"nonfactual\",\"evidence\":[],\"reason\":\"Open-ended question/suggestion without factual assertion.\"}],\"resource_behavior\":\"ignore\",\"rationale\":\"Candidate correctly ignored optional MS resource (dated 2024-12-01) which describes a different conversation context (parents' argument) than the current visible dialogue (friend's hospitalization).\",\"repairable\":false,\"repair_instruction\":\"\"}",
